Administrative Controls

Generating reports requires significant interaction with external systems such as GitHub and Kubernetes.

To avoid unnecessary API traffic:

* Report generation is restricted to Admin users.
* Deployment refresh operations are Admin-only.
* Developers have read-only visibility.
* Release Managers and Technical Leads can refresh release data whenever required.

This follows the same governance approach used by other internal AT&T engineering tools.

